  "description": "E-Curious? Open up new adventures, a new kind of fun with the E-Sentier, based on the hard charging geometry of our award winning Sentier hardtail.\n\n. Overcome the challenges and increase the fun with the turbo charged pedal power of the Shimano Steps drive system combined with the trail blasting fun of the Sentier\n\nThe E-Sentier VR is the beefed-up model. Marzocchi Bomber Z2 will take the hits as you make your way around the trails, Nukeproof cockpit for the ultimate control, and Maxxis tyres to ensure you have the grip. Shimano STEPS gives you the power when you need it most, with Shimano Drivetrain and Brakes for a spec you can depend on\n\nE-Sentier 6061 Alloy Boost Hardtail frame\n\nSHIMANO STEPS E7000 Motor\n\nEco, trail or Boost Power modes\n\nMarzocchi Bomber Z2 Suspension\n\nShimano Drivetrain & Brakes\n\nMaxxis Minion Tyre Combo",
